      "description": "The Ebenezer Methodist Church in Greene County, Tennessee, USA.  Ordained by Bishop Francis Asbury in 1795, the church is home to the oldest Methodist congregation in Tennessee.  The church pictured is the third to occupy the site, and was completed in 1899.  The church and its cemetery are now part of the Earnest Farms Historic District, with Henry Earnest being the cemetery's earliest burial (1809).\nCoordinates: N 36.19015, W 82.69318",
